---
// How Époisses was lost and found again, and the rule it is said to break.
---

<p>
	The french joke that Époisses is banned on public transport for its smell, and by god if you have ever smelled it, you understand why.
</p>
<p>
	It is one of my favorite cheeses however, the umami is unmatched. I rarely buy it because eating the whole thing in one sitting is a bit much and keeping half an Époisses in the fridge will stink up your flat... it's a shame they don't sell it in half-size portions.
</p>